  "state": "reviewed",
  "text": "Cloudflare's September 2026 announcement presents Monetization Gateway as a closed beta for charging agents per request with HTTP 402. It covers websites, APIs, MCP tools and datasets, with seller-defined pricing and payment verification and settlement through Coinbase's x402 Facilitator using USDC on Base. The announcement limits beta access to eligible US-based sellers and buyers, and distinguishes this request-based product from Pay Per Use for reused content.",
